<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Terminal Forex Court Terme - EUR/USD & GBP/USD</title>
    <script src="https://jsdelivr.net"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #090d16;
            --bg-card: #131b2e;
            --bg-input: #0b1120;
            --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
            --bullish: #10b981;
            --bearish: #f43f5e;
            --neutral: #f59e0b;
            --border: #1e293b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1250px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .session-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 4px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .dot {
            height: 9px;
            width: 9px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 4px;
        }

        .controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        select, button, input {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        select, button { cursor: pointer; }

        input {
            background-color: var(--bg-input);
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        button.primary-btn {
            background-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #090d16;
            border: none;
        }

        button.secondary-btn {
            background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            padding: 6px 10px;
        }

        button:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

        .grid-kpi {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .kpi-title {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        }

        .kpi-value {
            font-size: 1.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 6px 0;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 9px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .up { background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: var(--bullish); }
        .down { background-color: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.15); color: var(--bearish); }
        .flat { background-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: var(--neutral); }

        .main-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1.3fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 950px) {
            .main-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            height: 350px;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .advice-box {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .advice-item {
            background-color: rgba(9, 13, 22, 0.65);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .advice-item h3 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .advice-item p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .calc-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .calc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .inputs-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .inputs-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .input-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .calc-results {
            background-color: var(--bg-input);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .res-box span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .res-box strong {
            font-size: 1.55rem;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        .disclaimer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <div>
            <h1>FX Pulse <span style="color: var(--accent-blue);">Court Terme</span></h1>
            <div class="session-bar" id="session-status">
                <span>Chargement des sessions...</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="controls">
            <select id="pair-selector" onchange="loadForexData(false)">
                <option value="EUR">EUR / USD (Euro / Dollar US)</option>
                <option value="GBP">GBP / USD (Livre Sterling / Dollar US)</option>
            </select>
            <button class="primary-btn" onclick="loadForexData(true)">Forcer l'actualisation ↻</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid-kpi">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="kpi-title">Taux Actuel</div>
            <div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-price">--</div>
            <span class="badge" id="kpi-pips">--</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="kpi-title">Biais Intraday (24h)</div>
            <div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-bias">--</div>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;" id="kpi-percent">--</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="kpi-title">Résistance Court Terme</div>
            <div class="kpi-value" style="color: var(--bearish);" id="kpi-res">--</div>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Zone de prise de profit / vente</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="kpi-title">Support Court Terme</div>
            <div class="kpi-value" style="color: var(--bullish);" id="kpi-sup">--</div>
            <span style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Zone de rebond / Stop-Loss</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem;" id="chart-title">Historique Récent</h2>
                <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary);" id="data-source">Initialisation...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="fxChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card advice-box">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem;">Plan d'Action Court Terme</h2>
            <div id="advice-container"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
            <div>
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem;">Calculateur de Taille de Lot & Stop-Loss (<span id="calc-pair-label">EUR/USD</span>)</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Valeur standard : 10 $ par pip pour 1.00 lot (1 $ pour 0.10 mini-lot, 0.10 $ pour 0.01 micro-lot).</p>
            </div>
            <button class="secondary-btn" onclick="syncStopLossWithSupport()">Utiliser la distance du support actuel</button>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-grid">
            <div class="inputs-row">
                <div class="input-group">
